/*
 * Rule notes (vs. the original port):
 *  - Steps count only inside a real walk (cadence-based), so "30 хв" ≈ 2000 steps is meaningful.
 *  - Weather uses WeatherAPI condition codes (see WeatherKind), so "Light snow", showers, mist etc. match.
 *  - #60 used an unchecked `distance` field (was catchable anywhere after 400 steps) → 1300 steps ≈ 1 км.
 *  - #61 promised rain but checked evening hours (a copy of #59) → autumn + rain.
 *  - #41/#52 "sunny" vs "clear": WeatherAPI says "Clear" before sunrise / at night → CLEAR covers both.
 *  - #40 frost now ≤ 0 °C (−1…0 °C matched no pet before). #49/#51 step counts match their descriptions.
 */
